            "description": {
              "content": "Deletes a specific cloud migration session identified by its unique identifier (uid) in Grafana. This operation removes all data associated with the migration session, including configuration details, progress tracking information, and any temporary migration artifacts. Once deleted, the migration session cannot be recovered and any in-progress migration activities associated with this session will be terminated. This endpoint is typically used to clean up completed migrations or to cancel and remove unwanted migration sessions from the system.",
